   "description": "Earth System Models used in the Nordics such as CESM and NorESM are difficult to port on new architecture. We have worked on the packaging of ESMs and created containers (docker and singularity) to ease porting and improve the reproducibility of ESM simulations. In this Research Objects we aggregate all the timings we made with containers (and on bare metal) on HPC such as Betzy, Fram (Norwegian national HPC) and Lumi (EuroHPC). We show that ESM containers as as efficient as their bare metal counter parts (or even outperform bare metal simulation) with the advantage to be bit-reproducible.",
